eel-wasm 0.0.16 (bundled inside butterchurn.min.js)
https://github.com/captbaritone/eel-wasm

The eel-wasm repository carries no LICENSE file, at the pinned commit
(f7394d36640a8238e89e211ca7bbad73b34d7936) or since. Its licence is declared
only in packages/compiler/package.json:

    "license": "MIT",
    "author": "Jordan Eldredge <jordan@jordaneldredge.com>",

The text below is the standard MIT licence, attributed to the author that
package.json names. It is reconstructed from that field, because upstream
publishes no text of its own; no copyright year is given, because upstream
gives none.

